# A kick far too weak to bleach anything: the fields obey linear equations with constant coefficients, and light sloshes between the cavities at the coupling rate while it decays.
# Reference: the closed form from the eigenmodes of the coupled cavities, within 0.2%.
title Dark regime: pair k020
sites 2
link 1 2 kappa=0.2
kick 1 amplitude=0.001
run 45
expect total 0
expect count 1 0
expect count 2 0
expect intensity 1 3 2.76946664e-07 2e-3
expect intensity 2 3 1.29622995e-07 2e-3
expect intensity 1 8 7.73472249e-11 2e-3
expect intensity 2 8 9.06406061e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 1 12 1.48572602e-08 2e-3
expect total 0
